<title>UK: Macerich ups and prices Dec 2002 convertible. [CORRECTED 1600 GMT]</title>
<headline>Macerich ups and prices Dec 2002 convertible. [CORRECTED 1600 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Macerich Co has increased and priced its recent convertible bond, to $150 million from $125 milion, lead manager Lazard Capital Markets said on Friday.</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear the deal has been increased to $150 million from $125 million, but the greenshoe option has not been exercised. The $25 million greenshoe still stands).</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE MACERICH CO</p>
<p> AMT $150 MLN COUPON 7.25 MATURITY 15.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 LISTING    LUX/PORT   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	PREMIUM     10.18 PCT</p>
<p> CNV PRICE  $31.125</p>
<p> NOTES	HARD NO CAL FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A $25 MILLION GREENSHOE OPTION</p>
<p> -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658 (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
</text>
